// drydock nested/stealth Zellij config (REQ-16 / REQ-17, design D-22).
// Loaded when DRYDOCK_NESTED_ZELLIJ=1 and DRYDOCK_FORCE_INNER_ZELLIJ_FULL is unset.
//
// default_mode "locked": inner Zellij captures no keystrokes; the user's
// host Zellij session remains in control. The inner Zellij is effectively
// invisible as a multiplexer.
// simplified_ui true: ASCII-fies plugin chrome (removes arrow/powerline glyphs from
// plugin UI). It does NOT suppress the status-bar or tab-bar — per Zellij v0.41.2
// docs, it only "sends a request for a simplified ui (without arrow fonts) to plugins".
// REQ-16's "hide the status bar" acceptance criterion is satisfied by the LAYOUT
// (templates/zellij/layouts/drydock.kdl), which omits the `plugin location="status-bar"`
// and `plugin location="tab-bar"` entries that the default Zellij layout includes.
// pane_frames false: disables pane border decorations.

default_mode "locked"
pane_frames false
simplified_ui true
